    },
    {
      "id": "WSSvL6xJI5teVDBF3gQDW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 418.14589696502213,
      "y": 1138.072401876904,
      "width": 518.5595092773438,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1437998033,
      "version": 2366,
      "versionNonce": 757146496,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778093384959,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Create two variables for prt1 and ptr2 -> O(1) space complexity\n2. Set ptr1 to 0 and ptr2 to array count - 1\n3. While ptr1 is less than ptr2 -> O(n) time complexity\n    4. Swap prt1 and ptr2 values\n    5. Move ptr1 one index to the right\n    6. Move ptr2 one index to the left\n    7. Go to line 3\n8. Exit",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Create two variables for prt1 and ptr2 -> O(1) space complexity\n2. Set ptr1 to 0 and ptr2 to array count - 1\n3. While ptr1 is less than ptr2 -> O(n) time complexity\n    4. Swap prt1 and ptr2 values\n    5. Move ptr1 one index to the right\n    6. Move ptr2 one index to the left\n    7. Go to line 3\n8. Exit",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kxkL_sEMYQncod5Jk4zwl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 611.750387998349,
      "y": 753.1587374831455,
      "width": 277.47174072265625,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ae",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1344820179,
      "version": 577,
      "versionNonce": 1946710912,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778093050588,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> swap s[ptr1] and s[ptr2] values\n-> move ptr1 one index to the right\n-> move ptr2 one index to the left",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> swap s[ptr1] and s[ptr2] values\n-> move ptr1 one index to the right\n-> move ptr2 one index to the left",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
